161	    /**
162	     * The owner's membership number, formatted {@code <customerCode>-M<YY>} where {@code YY} is
163	     * the last two digits of the {@code registrationDate} year (e.g. {@code NSW-1A2B3C4D-M26}).
164	     * Derived from the owner's own fields; {@code null} until both are assigned.
