176	     * captured at creation time. It starts at 1, gains 1 when an email is present, gains a further
177	     * 1 when the owner has no namesakes ({@code namesakeCount} is 0), and is capped at 3. Level 4
178	     * is reserved for tenure and is never produced here.
179	     */
